    "description": "Enterprise Resource Allocation & Skill Management System - full API collection.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set the baseUrl variable if your server is not on http://localhost:8080.\n2. Run 'Auth > Login' with valid credentials. The returned JWT is saved automatically to the {{jwt}} collection variable.\n3. All other requests inherit Bearer {{jwt}} authentication automatically.\n\nReplace path ids (e.g. :id) and request-body values with real data from your database.",
